From 483b55ca84ada31992ef0b9f6744d51b9efe6f78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 11:00:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] docs: add libshaderc-devel to the Fedora build
 dependencies

The Vulkan renderer in the current libultraship includes
shaderc/shaderc.hpp, so the build fails on Fedora without
libshaderc-devel installed. Add it to both the gcc and clang dnf lines.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 docs/building.md | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/building.md b/docs/building.md
index e9e72edd..aa0cd19c 100644
--- a/docs/building.md
+++ b/docs/building.md
@@ -102,10 +102,10 @@ pacman -S clang git cmake ninja lsb-release sdl2 libpng libzip nlohmann-json tin
 #### Fedora
 ```sh
 # using gcc
-dnf install gcc gcc-c++ git cmake ninja-build lsb_release SDL2-devel libpng-devel libzip-devel libzip-tools nlohmann-json-devel tinyxml2-devel spdlog-devel boost-devel libogg-devel libvorbis-devel mbedtls-devel
+dnf install gcc gcc-c++ git cmake ninja-build lsb_release SDL2-devel libshaderc-devel libpng-devel libzip-devel libzip-tools nlohmann-json-devel tinyxml2-devel spdlog-devel boost-devel libogg-devel libvorbis-devel mbedtls-devel
 
 # or using clang
-dnf install clang git cmake ninja-build lsb_release SDL2-devel libpng-devel libzip-devel libzip-tools nlohmann-json-devel tinyxml2-devel spdlog-devel boost-devel libogg-devel libvorbis-devel mbedtls-devel
+dnf install clang git cmake ninja-build lsb_release SDL2-devel libshaderc-devel libpng-devel libzip-devel libzip-tools nlohmann-json-devel tinyxml2-devel spdlog-devel boost-devel libogg-devel libvorbis-devel mbedtls-devel
 ```
 #### openSUSE
 ```sh
